text I'm glad...
text Tomoyo puts her forehead against my chest.
text And I softly caress her hair.
text Something I couldn't accept had turned into something acceptable.
text I wonder if it's because of this... "family" she often talks about.
text I wonder if Tomoyo is something like family to me.
text The entire time, we had been separated.
text However, we both bore the exact same feelings.
text Both of us had been born to cold households, with no warmth at all.
text She truly was a long-lost relative.
