text I feel like, by doing this we've forgotten about something very important.
text But I wonder if that's what it means to grow up.
text Those kinds of important things never last very long.
text That's why people just live on somewhat damaged once they've lost those things.
text But that's just fine.
text If you get weighed down by too much stuff, you'll just end up getting weak.
text It's fine if you don't find something you might just end up losing anyway.
text That's why, Tomoyo...
text Don't go anywhere, all right?
text I've... already decided, I won't look for anything else anymore.
text Okay, Tomoyo?
